{"seq":3,"slug":"a-new-way-of-seeing","title":"A New Way Of Seeing","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/zhuangzi/core-contributions/a-new-way-of-seeing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"relativizing-perspectives","title":"相对的视野","url":"/c/people/zhuangzi/core-contributions/a-new-way-of-seeing/relativizing-perspectives","wordCount":1738,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-art-of-living","title":"生活的艺术","url":"/c/people/zhuangzi/core-contributions/a-new-way-of-seeing/the-art-of-living","wordCount":1839,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章呈现庄子独特的视野与人生智慧。庄子提供了一种\"相对的视野\"——洞察万物相对性、立场局限性，从而超越狭隘成见与是非彼此的对立，达到通达自由的境界。他的思想，更是一种\"生活的艺术\"——一种安顿身心、保全本真、顺应自然、自在生活的人生智慧。本章揭示庄子超越世俗、安顿心灵的深邃智慧。\n"}